---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import me from '../assets/me.jpg';
---

<section class="flex items-center justify-between gap-11 pt-7.5">
  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5">
    <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-text-3">
      <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-strong" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Open to remote roles
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-lg leading-[1.35] font-medium text-text-1">
      I build software that solves the real problem.<br />
      Sometimes that needs AI, often it doesn't.
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-160 text-base leading-[1.6] text-text-2">
      I've been building for the web professionally since 2015: full-stack developer, front-end
      lead, then leading a squad of engineers and solution consultants. I like software that stays
      simple and still makes sense a year later.
    </p>

    <p class="text-xs text-text-3">
      Bogor, Indonesia &nbsp;·&nbsp; UTC+7 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Full overlap with SG and AU, 4 to 6 hours
      with Europe, async with US teams &nbsp;·&nbsp; Contract, EOR, or full-time
    </p>
  </div>

  <Image
    src={me}
    alt="Opik"
    width={272}
    height={272}
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    class="size-34 shrink-0 rounded-2xl object-cover"
  />
</section>
